          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo baaghaayo emisengo kamaala inho, nga basagamba olw'okuba Katonda yabagha eisanhu lingi inho. Abakazi n'abaana boona baasagamba, era okusanhuka okwali mu Yerusalemu kwatuuka ghala inho okuva agho.",
          "type": "text",
