          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwo baataagho abantu ab'okulabiriranga amaterekero omwateebwanga ebigheebwayo eby'eisinzizo bino: ebirime ebisooka okukungulwa, n'ekintu ekirala ekirala ku buli bintu ikumi omuntu by'afuna. Era mu materekero omwo, mwe baasololezanga emigabo egyagheebwanga bakabona n'Abalevi okuva mu misiri egya buli kibuga, ng'Amateeka bwe galagira. Abayudaaya baakola batyo kuba baasanhukira inho ensambo bakabona n'Abalevi ye baagheerezangamu Katonda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nga baakola emikolo egy'okwetukuza, n'emikolo egindi, ng'oti n'abembi boona bwe baakolanga ogw'okwemba, n'abakuumi b'emiryango ni baakola ogw'okukuuma, bajiira ku kiragiro kya Daudi ni mutabane we Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuviira irala mu biseera bya Daudi ni Asafu, ghaabangagho akulira abembi era ghaabangagho n'enhembo edh'okusaaka n'edh'okwebaza Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era mu biseera bya Zerubbabeli ni mu bya Nehemia, Abaisiraeli boonaboona baaghangayo omugabo buli lunaku gwe baaghanga abembi n'abakuumi ab'emiryango. Era baaghangayo n'emigabo gy'Abalevi, ate Abalevi boona baayawulanga ku egyo, baaghaaku abaana ba Aaroni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
